 "findings": [
  "Kalshi official results are retrievable anonymously for all 8 evaluated NBA/NHL game series; result, settlement_ts, settlement_value_dollars and rules_primary are populated on 100% of returned markets (see field_fill).",
  "Depth (exhausted pagination): KXNBAGAME from 2025-04-16, KXNHLGAME from 2025-04-20, KXNHLTOTAL/KXNHLSPREAD from 2025-10-23, KXNHLTEAMTOTAL from 2026-09-30 (series appears new this season). Older seasons are not served by either endpoint for these tickers.",
  "NHL: all 26,051 matched yes/no markets (1 unmatched: a game not yet final at score-fetch time) agree with NHL API final scores under the convention that the shootout winner is credited one goal (official final score). Under the alternative (shootout goal excluded) 130 total/team-total markets in shootout games disagree. So nhl.settlement_goal_pmf must model the official final score INCLUDING the shootout goal.",
  "NBA: ESPN final scores agree with 55,410 of 55,414 checked markets; all 52,046 spread/total/team-total markets agree and 3,364 of 3,368 winner markets agree. The 4 disagreements are 2 PRESEASON events on 2025-10-10 (BOS@TOR, ORL@PHI) that Kalshi settled at 23:58 UTC, about one hour after the 23:00 UTC tip, with the opposite winner to ESPN's final score; treat Kalshi's result, not a re-derived final score, as the settlement label and flag such events.",
  "Internal consistency: every winner event has exactly one YES (3,589 events), no threshold ladder is non-monotonic (9,950 ladders); 72 markets settled 'scalar' (fair-price, e.g. KXNHLGAME-26JAN26LACBJ) and must be graded as neither YES nor NO.",
  "occurrence_datetime is missing on most historical rows (fill 0.19-0.55 overall); event dates are taken from the ticker / close_time instead."
 ],
